{"id": "DfZHMLLxysq", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Woh uske mehendi wale kadmon mein sar jhukane hi wala tha… usne haath utha ke rok diya. “Aisa mat karo.” 🤍\n\nEk bagh, ek nehar, aur do kinaare.\nWoh is paar, woh us paar… beech mein phawwaare, aur upar balcony se ghoorti hui nazar.\nShaam dhali, diye jal uthe, aur chaand dono ke beech aa ke ruk gaya.\nSar jhuka nahi sakta tha, toh usne nigaahein jhuka li.\nUsne dekha… aur sharma ke apni nigaahein bhi jhuka li.\nRaat ko kinaaron pe woh aaj bhi door baithe the… par chaandni paani mein unki parchhaiyan ek ho gayi. 🌹\n\nNusrat Fateh Ali Khan saab ki qawwali “Sar Jhukana Agar Jurm Hoga” mein woh ishq hai jo bolta nahi, sirf nigaahon se sajda karta hai. NFAK, hamesha ke liye 🤍\n\n🎵 Sar Jhukana Agar Jurm Hoga · Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan\n\nUs ek shakhs ko bhejo jiske saamne aaj bhi tumhari nigaahein jhuk jaati hain 🤍\n\n#nusratfatehalikhan #nfak #sufi", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793951552, "like_count": 2630, "comment_count": 7, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1768753197756736a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 61.829, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOkXTfXEUWCX0bANnVFwR_UYc6ZQYQqbOng9oVh26K3T581BoKvPiq2yrQatAkym9h4EhbURVJlHiXRH5ECXS3WYR3e9AWsLuMMo2c.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=cTHnG4hGJ30Q7kNvwEDLE12&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=LCMCpG10I9mrl5yNv_7i3g&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSDRwNKH0vf09AD_qkc2UF6AcY5cjmIbOxUbBHi6lRfaw&oe=6AF40AA2", "manifest_st